{"title":"List of international mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Elementary_school_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elementary school competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Middle_school_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Middle school competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#High_school_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">High school competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Undergraduate_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Undergraduate competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Open_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Open competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elementary_school_competitions\">Elementary school competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_international_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Elementary school competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifyhub.com/compete/\">Junior Math Championship</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Crazy_4_Math&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Crazy 4 Math (page does not exist)\">Crazy 4 Math</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_Kangaroo\" title=\"Mathematical Kangaroo\">Mathematical Kangaroo</a> is perhaps the world's largest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition\" title=\"Mathematics competition\">mathematics competition</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beestar_National_Competition\" title=\"Beestar National Competition\">Beestar National Competition</a>（BNC) - Each Grade 2  to 8，in Mar and Oct（<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.beestar.org/competition/\">https://www.beestar.org/competition/</a>)</li>\n<li>Math exercises for kids  - Daily mathemamatics competition (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.math-exercises-for-kids.com/competition/math-world-cup.php\">http://www.math-exercises-for-kids.com/competition/math-world-cup.php</a>)</li>\n<li>Online Elementary Mathematics Competition (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/2020oemc/2021-oemc?authuser=0\">https://sites.google.com/view/2020oemc/2021-oemc?authuser=0</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Championnat_international_des_jeux_math%C3%A9matiques_et_logiques\" title=\"Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques\">Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques</a> (categories CE and CM)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Think_Academy_Singapore_Math_Olympiad%EF%BC%88TASMO)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Think Academy Singapore Math Olympiad（TASMO) (page does not exist)\">Think Academy Singapore Math Olympiad（TASMO)</a>（<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://biz.thethinkacademy.com/link/l/EMcE\">https://biz.thethinkacademy.com/link/l/EMcE</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Singapore_Math_Classes_%26_Camps&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Singapore Math Classes &amp; Camps (page does not exist)\">Singapore Math Classes &amp; Camps</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://singaporemathclasses.com/events/virtual-math-competition/\">https://singaporemathclasses.com/events/virtual-math-competition/</a>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Middle_school_competitions\">Middle school competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_international_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Middle school competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifyhub.com/compete/\">Middle School International Math Championship</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.prismmaths.org\">Prism Maths Challenge</a> - designed and run by undergrads at Cambridge</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.internationalmathbowl.com/\">International Math Bowl</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://euclidlab.org/programs/archmidean-challenge/\">Archimedean Challenge #1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Crazy_4_Math&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Crazy 4 Math (page does not exist)\">Crazy 4 Math</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.integirls.org\">inteGIRLS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Online_MathChamps_Contest\" title=\"Online MathChamps Contest\">Online MathChamps Contest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beestar_National_Competition_BNC&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Beestar National Competition BNC (page does not exist)\">Beestar National Competition BNC</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.beestar.org\">http://www.beestar.org</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_Kangaroo\" title=\"Mathematical Kangaroo\">Mathematical Kangaroo</a> is perhaps the world's largest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition\" title=\"Mathematics competition\">mathematics competition</a>.</li>\n<li>Math Madness (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aretelabs.com/math_madness/about\">website</a>) (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c122241\">AoPS Forum</a>) 100% Online league and bracket tournament held in the fall (Mini-Madness held in spring)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Primary_Mathematics_World_Contest\" title=\"Primary Mathematics World Contest\">Primary Mathematics World Contest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Purple_Comet!_Math_Meet\" title=\"Purple Comet! Math Meet\">Purple Comet! Math Meet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_Mathematics,_Engineering_and_Science_Talent_Search&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wisconsin Mathematics, Engineering and Science Talent Search (page does not exist)\">Wisconsin Mathematics, Engineering and Science Talent Search</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Championnat_international_des_jeux_math%C3%A9matiques_et_logiques\" title=\"Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques\">Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques</a> (categories C1 and C2)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.thinkacademy.sg/courses/aggregational-detail/248/\">Think Academy Singapore Math Olympiad</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"High_school_competitions\">High school competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_international_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: High school competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifyhub.com/compete/\">High School International Math Championship</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.prismmaths.org\">Prism Maths Challenge</a> - designed and run by undergrads at Cambridge</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.internationalmathbowl.com/\">International Math Bowl</a></li>\n<li>[AoCMM Math Modeling Competition (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://aocmm.org/\">http://aocmm.org/</a>)]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cantor_Dust_Math_Tournament\" title=\"Cantor Dust Math Tournament\">Cantor Dust Math Tournament</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://euclidlab.org/programs/archmidean-challenge/\">Archimedean Challenge #1</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.integirls.org\">inteGIRLS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematics_Olympiad\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"International Mathematics Olympiad\">International Mathematics Olympiad</a> (IMO)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_Kangaroo\" title=\"Mathematical Kangaroo\">Mathematical Kangaroo</a> is perhaps the world's largest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition\" title=\"Mathematics competition\">mathematics competition</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Online_MathChamps_Contest\" title=\"Online MathChamps Contest\">Online MathChamps Contest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Trigonometry_Challenge\" title=\"International Trigonometry Challenge\">International Trigonometry Challenge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathlinks_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mathlinks Contest (page does not exist)\">Mathlinks Contest</a> by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Valentin_Vornicu\" title=\"Valentin Vornicu\">Valentin Vornicu</a></li>\n<li>Math Madness (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aretelabs.com/math_madness/about\">website</a>) (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c122241\">AoPS Forum</a>) 100% Online league and bracket tournament held in the fall (Mini-Madness held in spring)</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Purple_Comet!_Math_Meet\" title=\"Purple Comet! Math Meet\">Purple Comet! Math Meet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Tournament_of_Towns\" title=\"Tournament of Towns\">Tournament of Towns</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_Mathematics,_Engineering_and_Science_Talent_Search&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wisconsin Mathematics, Engineering and Science Talent Search (page does not exist)\">Wisconsin Mathematics, Engineering and Science Talent Search</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Science_and_Engineering_Fair\" title=\"International Science and Engineering Fair\">International Science and Engineering Fair</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Championnat_international_des_jeux_math%C3%A9matiques_et_logiques\" title=\"Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques\">Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques</a> (category L1)</li>\n<li>[[Intercontinental Mathematical Olympiad [ICMO] (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/icmo/home\">https://sites.google.com/view/icmo/home</a>)]] (online mathematical Olympiad)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Undergraduate_competitions\">Undergraduate competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_international_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Undergraduate competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematics_Competition\" title=\"International Mathematics Competition\">International Mathematics Competition</a> (IMC)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Open_mathematical_Olympiad_for_University_Students\" title=\"Open mathematical Olympiad for University Students\">Open mathematical Olympiad for University Students</a> (OMOUS)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Championnat_international_des_jeux_math%C3%A9matiques_et_logiques\" title=\"Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques\">Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques</a> (category L2)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Open_competitions\">Open competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_international_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Open competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=SolveFire\" title=\"SolveFire\">SolveFire</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.solvefire.net/\">see here</a>) Weekly math competitions with difficulties ranging from AMC 8 - USAMO. People of all ages welcome. (Codeforces for math)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifyhub.com/compete/\">International Math Championship</a> - Free Competition for students grades 1-12</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Championnat_international_des_jeux_math%C3%A9matiques_et_logiques\" title=\"Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques\">Championnat international des jeux mathématiques et logiques</a> for all aged 9+ (expanding and looking for US representatives)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://meridianmath.org\">Meridian</a> &#8211; a free online olympiad-style contest open to anyone of any age and country. Four problems, four hours. First edition in September 2026.</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yandex_Q.E.D._Math_Challenge_2018\" title=\"Yandex Q.E.D. Math Challenge 2018\">Yandex Q.E.D. Math Challenge 2018</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_international_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_regional_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of regional mathematics competitions\">List of regional mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_competitions\" title=\"Science competitions\">Science competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018093446\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 53/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip